  "entries": [
    {"entry_index":60,"uid":"zhcn:4a4f1ca3f091805970cb8835","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"似乎有礼物送到了呢\n拆开的乐趣…呢。呵呵。","source_fingerprint":"b4f895d7959cee5a742929b1c42962b3d60260410d648daef7f317f6eee624fb","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1097","10016"],"target_text":"Có vẻ quà đã được gửi tới rồi.\nNiềm vui lúc mở ra… nhỉ. Hì hì.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":61,"uid":"zhcn:8c36dbe698b04afb2d335aa2","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"似乎有达成的任务呢\n呵呵，辛苦您了。","source_fingerprint":"0786a967cb7d1cff567aba3665f4715749e35b36b3f2580f5e621ba036854fb0","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1097","10017"],"target_text":"Có vẻ có Mission đã hoàn thành rồi.\nHì hì, bạn vất vả rồi.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":62,"uid":"zhcn:4e7b6128c2b77270f7663195","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"似乎要举办活动了。\n…那孩子也开始躁动了…","source_fingerprint":"7e8399def5dec4a9ca5540e8a6a14223bffbe5caa21f13ba17a9c706827b4c92","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1097","10018"],"target_text":"Có vẻ sắp có sự kiện.\n…Đứa trẻ ấy cũng bắt đầu rục rịch rồi…","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":63,"uid":"zhcn:8698b2892bea056d57009b0f","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"活动似乎很热闹。\n沉迷过度的话…必须注意\n不要展现出不得体的模样。","source_fingerprint":"ca60c69f5d8e693e618b58971adf6ca75071add9d0bb672337f2a50c7a04e8a1","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1097","10019"],"target_text":"Sự kiện có vẻ rất náo nhiệt.\nNếu quá mải mê… phải cẩn thận\nđừng để lộ dáng vẻ thất thố.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":64,"uid":"zhcn:1405fc3040efd48936aa11af","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"让他逃掉了…","source_fingerprint":"3da9c40405bc61cea7d7e79e61aaba3a1fc8f14acc5be3edac6ca2fd3ec7b6c6","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1097","1002"],"target_text":"Để hắn thoát mất rồi…","reviewed":true}
  ]
